  "description": "<p>RainSisters is a brand that produces unique and stylish design coats that embody femininity and the celebration of life.</p>\r\n<p>RainSisters' coats are designed to make you stand out from the crowd with their unique floral patterns and not-mainstream figure-flattering cuts.</p>\r\n<p>Coats are made with membrane fabric, which is waterproof, warm, breathable, and soft, providing 100% comfort and protection from unexpected weather conditions. The coat has a large hood with adjustable tighteners, hidden snap buttons, and large hidden pockets to keep your essentials.</p>\r\n<p>RainSisters is a slow fashion brand that uses only high-quality and extra-durable materials in production. Their coats are handmade locally in an ethical and fair manner, produced in small amounts, and designed to be timeless.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;RainSisters is a family-owned brand run by three Latvian sisters who are standing behind the brand. They started the brand by sewing a few coats themselves and have now shipped their coats all over the world, getting lots of love from customers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
